{"unit_id":"huihui0927__dsh-config-sync#caveat-manual-plugin-install","repo":"huihui0927/dsh-config-sync","commit":"caced7efb6ccde0f5609f0c4b48b0369d477c925","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-config-sync 使用前须知：还原归档会恢复配置文件，但不会包含 node_modules；应用后仍需按返回的命令逐个安装插件并重启 DSH。（见 lib/archive.js:506-525）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/archive.js:506-525"]}
